 "_doc": "TEMPORAL-1 (Rowan, 2026-11-21): time and iteration are part of the system. Thresholds and sources for foundation/temporal.py. Windows are complete days and shrink to the history that exists. A tenant ships its own copy of this file (areas, ledgers, entries); anything it leaves out falls back to this one's values. Consumers: foundation/temporal.py, .github/workflows/temporal.yml, site/temporal.js, dashboard/worker.js, doctrine/detectors.json (temporal-drift), foundation/pathfinder.py (temporal: routes), foundation/rnd.py (boost).",
